    <key>PayloadDescription</key>
    <string>Adblock Edit By Hoang Phuc (v6.0):
- Chan quang cao manh hon qua DNS so voi v5.0.
- 8 lua chon DNS tu cac nha cung cap uy tin nhat 2026.
- VIP01: AdGuard DNS - Chan Ads + Trackers.
- VIP02: Mullvad Base - Chan Ads + Trackers + Malware.
- VIP03: Mullvad Extended - Chan Ads + Trackers + Malware + Mang xa hoi.
- VIP04: AdGuard Family - Chan Ads + Noi dung nguoi lon.
- VIP05: Mullvad Family - Chan manh nhat (Ads + Trackers + Malware + Adult + Co bac).
- VIP06: DNSForge - Chan Ads + Trackers (backup).
- VIP07: CleanBrowsing Family - Ep SafeSearch, chan triet de 18+ khong lá»t.
- VIP08: Control D Family - Dung AI loc Porn, Ads toc do cao.
- Ho tro chan 1 phan quang cao tren Youtube, Facebook.
- Khong hao pin va on dinh hon VPN.
- Ho tro tat ca iOS, iPad, MacOS, TvOS.
- Ho tro 3G/4G/5G va Wifi.</string>
